                  "id": "heading-1",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The 2027 Truck Transition: How Engine Costs Could Change Buyer Behavior",
                    "headingLevel": 1
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "text-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Beginning January 1, 2027, the EPA's NOx rule will influence the commercial trucking industry with notable changes on both cost structures and buyer behaviors. It is essential for dealer owners, general managers, and fleet managers to comprehend these industry shifts to make informed purchasing decisions."
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
