                {
                  "id": "heading-2",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "EPA 2027 NOx Rule Impact",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "text-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "With the GHG Phase 3 rolled back, the focus sharpens on the NOx/PM standards. As a result, compliant Class 8 trucks are projected to cost an additional $8,000–$12,000 per unit. This cost increase pivots industry dynamics, influencing both new and used truck markets."
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
