                {
                  "id": "heading-3",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Market Response and Pre-Buy Effect",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "text-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The rush to secure 2026 build slots resulted in the pre-buy phase effectively concluding by August 2026. As new options face price hikes, interest shifts towards pre-2027 used units, marking a change in buyer timing and preference."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "quote-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "\"The demand for proven, pre-2027 trucks is surging as buyers seek to avoid elevated 2027 prices.\"",
                    "align": "center"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
