                  "props": {
                    "text": "Buyer Mindsets Diverge",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "text-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Dealers are encountering three buyer mindsets: cost-avoidance, who focus on minimizing expenditure; proven-technology enthusiasts, who prioritize established vehicle performance; and compliance-forward individuals, who aim to ensure adherence to upcoming standards."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "quote-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "\"Understanding these mindsets is vital for aligning inventory strategies.\"",
                    "align": "center"
