                  "props": {
                    "text": "FAQs on the 2027 Transition",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "text-6",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "**What are the key changes in the 2027 NOx rule?**\nThe 2027 NOx rule focuses on stricter NOx/PM emissions standards, unlike the rescinded GHG Phase 3.\n\n**How will these changes affect truck pricing?**\nCompliant vehicles are expected to be $8,000–$12,000 more expensive due to the new regulations.\n\n**What should buyers consider when purchasing post-2027 trucks?**\nAgendas must include the model year, emissions certification, engine, warranty, maintenance records, and pricing."
                  }
                }
              ]
